&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;AI/DXプロダクト&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(法人向けAI/DX人材育成支援)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
