  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E38690-000IshikawaAkihikoMember">注３．</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E38690-000ShimizuToshihiroMember">取締役執行役員 CTO 技術本部本部長</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E38690-000ShimizuToshihiroMember">清水　俊博</jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E38690-000ShimizuToshihiroMember">1979-09-21</jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E38690-000ShimizuToshihiroMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2005年４月　株式会社ユー・エス・イー　入社&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 3px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2009年９月　株式会社ドワンゴ　入社&lt;/span&gt;
